# aek-skill-manager — third-party source attribution

This package's engine and CLI are ported module-by-module (not vendored
whole-project) from the MIT-licensed projects below. Each ported module is
pinned to the source git SHA and date so the provenance stays auditable.

## Ported modules

- **Engine + CLI (the core of `src/core`, `src/cli`, `src/infra`, `src/shared`,
  plus the bundled manager skill under `skills/` and `docs/CLI*`)**
  from `shenysun/skills-manager` (MIT).
  Pinned at: `fae0bb864a8b96c1d0ca6278a6b7062e62992a36` (2026-10-27).
  License text: `licenses/LICENSE-shenysun-skills-manager-MIT.txt`.
  Copyright (c) 2026 Sun Yongshen.
  Ported with the `~/.skills-manager` hub default re-rooted to
  `~/.aek/skill-manager` (override: `AEK_SKILL_MANAGER_HOME` / `SKILL_HOME` /
  `--home`), the fastify/vue dashboard + its `web` command dropped (AEK serves
  its webui through the coraek plugin instead), and CLI branding renamed to
  `aeksm` / `aek-skill-manager`.

- **Windows directory-junction symlink abstraction** (T3, ported into
  `src/infra/link-policy.ts` — `createDirLink`)
  from `luongnv89/asm` (MIT).
  Pinned at: `65fbfb16db2df92eeabe0d8aa36a3ca9c97f81cc` (2026-11-01).
